cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use techne, please cite it as below.
title: "techne: opinionated Claude Code skills for repo hygiene"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin of skills for keeping repositories honest: audits of
  local builds and CI runs, drift checks between documentation and code and
  across linked repositories, adversarial pre-merge review, and document builds
  from LaTeX and markdown sources that are gated on what the output actually
  contains.
type: software
authors:
